  prologue: "Beyond the wood the land was scabbed with red thorns, a second pillar
    sweating ember-light. The Demon Lord's handwriting was in the soil now.\n\nAthena's
    voice was quieter. Choose carefully. Some steps cannot be untaken."
  deathLine: Ash took Theo. The book coughed out a black smudge, then a blank line.
  tutorialText: Red thorns. Blessed Step walks them. Gaps still kill.
